			"• 肘、膝は二重関節で抜群の可動性を誇る！シールドやバズーカ、バルカン・ポッドなど各種武装も付属！",
			"成形品×10、ホイルシール×1、組立説明書×1"
		],
		"en": [
			"• From \"Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam\", the white \"Gundam Mk-II\" with AEG specifications is now available as the 4th installment of the HG series \"Reborn -REVIVE-\"!",
			"• Achieves sophisticated proportions while pursuing the image in the play with a completely new model using the latest format!",
			"• Elbows and knees are double jointed for outstanding mobility! Various weapons such as a seal, bazooka, and Vulcan pod are also included!",
			"Molded product x 10, foil seal x 1, assembly manual x 1"
